Omarchy desktop AIO widget
==========================

A Ryoku-style all-in-one desktop widget for Omarchy: weather, day, clock, date
and a live cava audio spectrum, on a click-through bottom-layer Wayland surface.

Portions of this project are adapted from Ryoku
(https://github.com/Ryoku-dev/ryoku), which is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).

Specifically adapted:
  - widgets/AioWidget.qml   <- ryoku/shell/quickshell/shell/modules/desktop/aio/AioWidget.qml
  - AudioBars.qml           <- ryoku/shell/quickshell/shell/services/AudioBars.qml
  - Wmo.js (weather codes)  <- ryoku/shell/quickshell/shell/services/lib/weather.js

Because of that, this widget is distributed under the GPL-3.0 as well.
See <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html>.

The Ryoku-specific runtime (ryoku-shell daemon, widget host, matugen palette,
material-you scheme) is NOT used; weather, configuration and theming are
reimplemented for Omarchy (Open-Meteo + Omarchy theme colors).
